---
title: Gateau aux Poire
description: A very simple but remarkably tasty French pear dessert
source: French exchange hosts
course: Dessert
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Medium
prep time: 15m
cook time: 40m
cuisine: French
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
